msgstr "Spotifast {version} • niet verbonden aan Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:168
msgid ""
"That doesn't look like a Client ID. It is 32 letters and digits, shown on "
"your app's page in the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Dat lijkt geen Client ID. Die bestaat uit 32 letters en cijfers en staat op "
"de pagina van je app in het dashboard."

#: src/ui/login.rs:172
msgid ""
"Spotify doesn't know this Client ID. Copy it again from your app's page in "
"the dashboard."
msgstr ""
"Spotify kent deze Client ID niet. Kopieer die opnieuw van de pagina van je "
"app in het dashboard."

#: src/ui/login.rs:176
msgid ""
"Spotify didn't let this account use the app. Sign in with the Spotify "
"account that created it, which needs Premium."
msgstr ""
"Spotify liet dit account de app niet gebruiken. Log in met het Spotify-"
"account dat de app heeft gemaakt. Dat account heeft Premium nodig."

#: src/ui/login.rs:180
msgid ""
"Spotify no longer accepts the shared sign-in Spotifast used before. Set up "
"your own Spotify app to keep listening."
msgstr ""
"Spotify accepteert de gedeelde aanmelding die Spotifast eerder gebruikte "
"niet meer. Stel je eigen Spotify-app in om te blijven luisteren."

#: src/ui/login.rs:217
msgid "A native Spotify client."
msgstr "Een native Spotify-client."

#: src/ui/login.rs:231
msgid "Waiting for Spotify in your browser…"
msgstr "Wachten op Spotify in je browser…"

#: src/ui/login.rs:239
msgid "Didn't open? Open the sign-in page again"
msgstr "Niet geopend? Open de inlogpagina opnieuw"

#: src/ui/login.rs:255
#, rust-format
msgid ""
"If Spotify says “Invalid redirect URI”, add {uri} to your app exactly, save, "
"and sign in again."
msgstr ""
"Zegt Spotify “Invalid redirect URI”, voeg dan {uri} precies zo toe aan je "
"app, sla op en log opnieuw in."

#: src/ui/login.rs:302
msgid "Sign in with Spotify"
msgstr "Inloggen met Spotify"

#: src/ui/login.rs:317
msgid ""
"Sign in through your browser. Spotifast never sees your password. Local "
"playback needs Spotify Premium."
msgstr ""
"Log in via je browser. Spotifast ziet je wachtwoord nooit. Lokaal afspelen "
"vereist Spotify Premium."

#: src/ui/login.rs:326
msgid "How to set up your Spotify app"
msgstr "Zo stel je je Spotify-app in"

#: src/ui/login.rs:346
msgid "Proxy Settings"
