msgstr "Gekopieerd"

#: src/ui/mod.rs:385
msgid "Spotify is being slow on the shared app."
msgstr "Spotify is traag met de gedeelde app."

#: src/ui/mod.rs:388
msgid ""
"Spotifast no longer offers the shared app, and Spotify can stop accepting it "
"at any time. Set up your own free Spotify app and you won't have to wait."
msgstr ""
"Spotifast biedt de gedeelde app niet meer aan, en Spotify kan die op elk "
"moment weigeren. Stel je eigen gratis Spotify-app in, dan hoef je niet te "
"wachten."

